  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reproductive health interventions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component of the Joint Programme For Girls&apos; Education focuses on inforformation about Sexual and Reproductive Health ans Rights (SRHR) as well as increased access to youth friendly health services in the targeted communities. The aim is to avoid early pregnancies and transmission of diseases, and in that way contribute to better health among adolecent girls and young women, as well as increased tranistion from primary to secondary education.</narrative>
  </description>
